{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A pluggable persistence backend for offline document state."}],"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Inherits From","type":"inheritsFrom","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships"},{"title":"Conforming Types","type":"conformingTypes","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore"],"kind":"relationships"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DocStore","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It is deliberately a snapshot plus an append-only change log rather than one opaque","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"blob. Re-serializing the whole document on every edit costs time proportional to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"document – hundreds of milliseconds on a large one – and a document is at its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"largest while it is being edited, which is exactly when the writes happen. Appending","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"costs the size of one change, which does not grow with the document at all.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The interface stays byte-oriented and async so a durable backend can implement it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without the client knowing which storage it talks to, and so a backend is free to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"compress or encrypt what it is handed. The default ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/MemoryDocStore"},{"text":" keeps","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"everything in a process-local dictionary and carries no dependency.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore"},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Protocol","externalID":"s:6Yorkie8DocStoreP","symbolKind":"protocol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DocStore","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Yorkie"}],"title":"DocStore","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"DocStore"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore\/appendChange(docKey:change:)","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore\/load(docKey:)","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore\/remove(docKey:)","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore\/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)","doc:\/\/Yorkie\/documentation\/Yorkie\/DocStore\/saveSnapshot(docKey:bytes:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/yorkie\/docstore"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Yorkie/documentation/Yorkie/DocStore/saveMeta(docKey:bytes:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Records the post-sync header.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"saveMeta","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"docKey","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"bytes","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Data","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4DataV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{